{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/items/245311/", "pk": 245311, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/", "pk": 2623, "shortname": "lavidalaguna", "name": "La Vida Laguna", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Electric Bike Rentals - In Store Rentals", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "Electric Bike Rentals - In Store Rentals", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Full - Please call to book", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": false, "sortable_index": 2312, "description": "#Electric Bike Rentals\n\n##Duration\n**Half Day Rental: 4 hours** \n**Full Day Rental: 8 hours** \n\n##About\nCome experience the thrill of pedal-assisted biking, and see Laguna as you've never seen it before. You'll experience how easy it is to traverse our town safely without ever getting on Coast Highway. You'll see historic homes, local art, and some of the most beautiful neighborhoods and architecture in the world.\n\n**Directions, parking, and what to bring are contained in the reservation confirmation email.**", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "With our trailer, chase vehicle and fleet of more than 40 speed mountain bikes, we have developed a special aptitude for leading group bike rides throughout Southern California. No matter what your groups desires, we have a ride.\n\nLaguna Back Roads: Experience the sublime beauty of Laguna Beach on this safe and historic loop that bypasses Pacific Coast Highway. Pedal the quaint Craftsman neighborhoods and gardens, access amazing view corridors, stop at Heisler Park to see the magnificent public art, experience the charming downtown commercial district, and many artists residences.", "location": "Laguna Beach, CA", "booking_notes": "Thank you for choosing **La Vida Laguna** for your coastal ebike rental!\n\n**The health and safety of our guests, staff, and community are our top priority**\nFollowing current guidelines, we are sanitizing, wearing masks, and practicing physical distancing. We ask that you arrive wearing a face covering, as mandated by our state and local government. Once we issue your bike you may wear your mask at your own discretion.  \n\n\n**We provide:** pedal assist ebike, helmets, and bike lock\n\nWe meet you at your scheduled time at our La Vida Headquarters, located at **1121 Glenneyre St. Laguna Beach, CA 92651**. We are located on the southwest corner of Glenneyre and Oak St.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** We share the same address with our neighbors to the left of our entrance.   Our shop has the prominent white door and frame. \n\t\n**Parking:** There is plenty of metered parking along Glenneyre (they take credit cards), or free parking in the adjacent neighborhood.\n\n**Suggested Attire:** shorts, leggings, tennis shoes, sunglasses, and sunblock. No purses or hanging bags. \n\n\nLaguna tends to be easy on an ebike although you with experience moderate climbs and descents. Not strenuous with pedal assist bikes! DO NOT RIDE ON COAST HIGHWAY!\n\nIf you have any questions, please do not hesitate to call (949) 275-7544.", "cancellation_notes": "Because we have limited capacities, this booking is not cancelable within 24 hours.  Cancellations received 24 hours prior to rental will receive a full refund. If La Vida Laguna cancels the rental because of unsafe weather conditions, you will receive a full refund.  Due to potential changes in weather conditions, we reserve the right to cancel  at any time.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "4 or 8 hour Rentals • Ages 16+", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/items/245311/images/449711/", "pk": 449711, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5DblDrT3Rqm8oZLbXOeQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5DblDrT3Rqm8oZLbXOeQ", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/items/245311/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5DblDrT3Rqm8oZLbXOeQ", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5DblDrT3Rqm8oZLbXOeQ", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/items/245311/images/449712/", "pk": 449712, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/B3s1MabSfa3YNaIpwO5F", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/B3s1MabSfa3YNaIpwO5F", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/items/245311/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/B3s1MabSfa3YNaIpwO5F", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/B3s1MabSfa3YNaIpwO5F", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/lavidalaguna/items/245311/images/449713/", "pk": 449713, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.c